# ----------------------------------------------
# File Name:    99__PACKAGE_NAME__-docker-info
# Version:      1.0
# Authors:      whoy@ukaachen.de
# Date:         06 Aug 26
# Purpose:      APT hook to trigger Docker DWH version info update after package lists are updated
# ----------------------------------------------

# Run version info check for every docker DWH tenant after each apt update.
# REMOTE_ADDR/REMOTE_PORT are explicitly cleared: apt (and thus this hook) may
# itself be a child of a socket-activated service (e.g. the debian info socket's
# "apt update"), which would otherwise leak that unrelated client's address in
# and make this script mistake a plain apt run for its own socket being hit.
APT::Update::Post-Invoke {"env -u REMOTE_ADDR -u REMOTE_PORT /usr/bin/__PACKAGE_NAME__-docker-info";};
